<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-SAMPRAS WINS ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAMPRAS WINS ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the ATP world tennis championship on Sunday (prefix number denotes world ranking):</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 6-Boris Becker (Germany) 3-6 7-6 (7- 5) 7-6 (7-4) 6-7 (11-13) 6-4</p>
</text>
